OL,3,GNEWSAFirst woman in garden's top job in
OL,4,A332-year history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former geography teacher has become
OL,7,Fthe first woman to helm a garden in its
OL,8,F332-year history.
OL,10,FLevens Hall, near Kendal, Cumbria,
OL,11,Fholds the Guinness World Record for the
OL,12,Foldest topiary garden and has only
OL,13,Femployed 11 head gardeners since it its
OL,14,Fcreation in 1694.
OL,16,FGillian Boyle is now the 12th and said
OL,17,Fbeing the first woman to take on the
OL,18,Frole was not a big deal, but still good
OL,19,Fnews.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
