OL,3,GNEWSAFirst woman in garden's top job in
OL,4,A332-year history
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said she returned to her "primary
OL,7,Fpassion" of gardening and trained in
OL,8,Fhorticulture because she wanted to
OL,9,Fspend more time outside, and has now
OL,10,Fmoved into a cottage on the estate
OL,11,Fhaving taken on "the best job ever".
